{"id":"22-4538-2-2","zh":"Rudhādi 类（rudha 等词根类）","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4539-2-6","zh":"下面讲述 rudha 等词根类。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4540-2-33","zh":"“主动语态”一词承上延续；依“多用”的统辖，它表明词干后缀在主动语态中固定出现，在无人称语态和被动语态中则不固定，可有可无；因此应当知道，在无人称语态、被动语态以及使役形式中，词干后缀也会出现。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4541-2-23","zh":"Chida、bhida、bhuja、muca、yuja、rica、rudha、lipa、vida、sica、subha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4542-2-36","zh":"660. 以及 ṃ，用于 rudha 等词根〔ka.446；rū.509；nī.926；caṃ.1.1.93；pā.3.1.78〕。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4543-2-36","zh":"在 rudha 等表示动作的词根之后，主动语态中加 la 词缀，并且在这些 rudha 等词根的前末元音之后添加鼻化音 ṃ；带标记音 m 是为了表明插入前末位置，a 音是为了便于发音；用 ca（“以及”）一词，把 rudha、subha 等词根之后的 i、ī、e、o 词缀也包括进来；鼻化音变为所在音组的末音。","confidence":60}
{"id":"22-4544-2-3","zh":"Rundhati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4545-2-7","zh":"Chida 词根，义为分成两半：chindati、chindanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4546-2-22","zh":"被动语态加 kya；依“ta 组、va、ra、ṇa 遇 ya 时变为 ca 组、ba、ya、ña”这条规则，在 ya 之前词根末音变为 ca 组音；依“在 va 组、la、sa 之后”这条规则，ya 变为与前音相同。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4546-23-26","zh":"Chijjati、chijjanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4547-2-22","zh":"依“前有重音节时，短元音之后的 nte、ntī 变为 re”这条规则，nte、ntī 等四个词尾变为 re：chindate、chijjate、chijjante、chijjare。","confidence":60}
{"id":"22-4548-2-12","zh":"依本条规则添加鼻化音：chindīyati、chindīyanti、chindīyate、chindīyante。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4549-2-17","zh":"使役：chedeti、chedayati、chedāpeti、chedāpayati、chindeti、chindayati、chindāpeti、chindāpayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4550-2-14","zh":"ī 等词尾（过去时）：acchindi、chindi、acchinduṃ、chinduṃ、acchindiṃsu、chindiṃsu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4551-2-41","zh":"依大释，词根末音变为 ccha，并且前一音重叠：acchecchi taṇhaṃ, vivattayi saṃyojanaṃ（他断除了渴爱，转离了结缚）〔itivu.53〕；也可以见到属于 divādi 类的读法“acchejjī”；acchecchuṃ vata bho rukkhaṃ（啊，他们竟然砍倒了树）〔jā.2.22.1788〕。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4552-2-9","zh":"被动：acchijji、chijji、acchindiyi、chindiyi。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4553-2-19","zh":"使役：chedesi、kaṇṇanāsañca chedayi（又割下了耳朵和鼻子）〔jā.1.4.49〕、chindesi、chindayi。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4554-2-30","zh":"ssati 等词尾（将来时）：依“labha、vasa、chida、gama、bhida、ruda 的词根末音连同 ssa 变为 ccha”这条规则，词根末音连同 ssa 变为 ccha：checchati、chindissati、checchanti、chindissanti、checchasi、checchata、checchāmi、checchāma、chindissāma。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4555-2-9","zh":"ssā 等词尾（条件式）：acchecchā、acchindissā、acchecchaṃsu、acchindissaṃsu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4556-2-7","zh":"Bhida 词根，义为破裂：bhindati、bhindanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4557-2-11","zh":"被动：bhijjati、bhijjanti、bhijjare、bhindiyati、bhindiyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4558-2-24","zh":"使役：bhikkhū bhikkhūhi bhedeti（使比丘与比丘分裂）〔mahāva.107〕、bhedayati、bhedāpeti、bhedāpayati、bhindeti、bhindayati、bhindāpeti、bhindāpayati。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4559-2-5","zh":"被动：bhedīyati、bhedāpīyati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4560-2-13","zh":"ī 等词尾：abhindi、bhindi、abhinduṃ、bhinduṃ、abhindiṃsu、bhindiṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4561-2-9","zh":"被动：abhijji、bhijji、abhindiyi、bhindiyi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4562-2-13","zh":"使役：abhedesi、bhedesi、abhedayi、bhedayi、bhedāpesi、bhedāpayi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4563-2-49","zh":"ssati 等词尾：依“labhavasa…”等规则，d 连同 ssa 变为 ccha：bhecchati、bhindissati、bhecchanti、bhindissanti、bhecchasi、bhecchatha、bhecchāmi、bhecchāma、bhindissāma；“taṃ te paññāya bhecchāmi”（我将用智慧破除你的它）〔su.ni.445〕是圣典原文。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4564-2-5","zh":"ssā 等词尾：acchecchā、acchindissā 等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4565-2-9","zh":"Bhuja 词根，义为保护、受用：bhuñjati、bhuñjanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4566-2-5","zh":"被动：bhujjati、bhujjanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4567-2-9","zh":"使役：bhojeti、bhojayati、bhojāpeti、bhojāpayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4568-2-5","zh":"被动：bhojīyati、bhojāpīyati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4569-2-30","zh":"ssati 等词尾：依“vaca、bhuja、muca、visa 的词根末音连同 ssa 变为 kkha”这条规则，词根末音连同 ssa 变为 kkha，并且首音强化：bhokkhati、bhuñjissati、bhokkhanti、bhokkhasi、bhokkhatha、bhokkhāmi、bhokkhāma、bhuñjissāma。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4570-2-10","zh":"ssā 等词尾：abhokkhā、abhuñjissā、abhokkhaṃsu、abhuñjissaṃsu 等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4571-2-9","zh":"Muca 词根，义为释放：muñcati、muñcanti、muñcare。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4572-2-9","zh":"被动：muccati、muccanti、muñcīyati、muñcīyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4573-2-5","zh":"使役：mocāpeti、mocāpayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4574-2-9","zh":"ī 等词尾：amuñci、muñci、amuñciṃsu、muñciṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4575-2-25","zh":"使役：amocesi、mocesi、amocayi、mocayi、amocesuṃ、mocesuṃ、amocayuṃ、mocayuṃ、amociṃsu、mociṃsu、amocayiṃsu、mocayiṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4576-2-20","zh":"ssati 等词尾：c 连同 ssa 变为 kkha：mokkhati、muñcissati、mokkhanti mārabandhanā（他们将脱离魔的束缚）〔dha.pa.37〕。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4576-21-34","zh":"Na me samaṇa mokkhasi（沙门，你逃不出我的手）〔saṃ.ni.1.140〕。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4576-35-42","zh":"Mokkhatha、mokkhāmi、mokkhāma、muñcissāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4577-2-18","zh":"ssā 等词尾：amokkhā、mokkhā、amuñcissā、muñcissā、amokkhaṃsu、mokkhaṃsu、amuñcissaṃsu、muñcissaṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4578-2-24","zh":"Yuja 词根，义为结合：yuñjati buddhasāsane（致力于佛陀的教法），意思是着手修行；yuñjanti；pamādamanuyuñjanti, bālā dummedhino janā（愚昧无智的人们沉溺于放逸）〔dha.pa.26〕。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4578-25-38","zh":"Yuñjasi；yuñjatha buddhasāsane（你们要致力于佛陀的教法）〔saṃ.ni.1.185〕。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4578-39-42","zh":"Yuñjāmi、yuñjāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4579-2-5","zh":"被动：yuñjīyati、yuñjīyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4580-2-17","zh":"使役：yojeti、payojeti、niyojeti、uyyojeti、yojayati、payojayati、niyojayati、uyyojayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4581-2-9","zh":"被动：yojīyati、payojīyati、niyojīyati、uyyojīyati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4582-2-35","zh":"Rudha 词根，义为遮障：rundhati、rundhiti、rundhīti、rundheti、rundhoti、rundhanti、orundhati、avarundhati、rundhāpeti、rundhāpayati、avarodheti、avarodhayati、uparodheti、uparodhayati、rodhāpeti、rodhāpayati。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4583-2-4","zh":"被动：avarodhīyati 等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4584-2-7","zh":"Lipa 词根，义为涂抹：limpati、limpanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4585-2-3","zh":"被动：limpīyati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4586-2-18","zh":"使役：limpeti、limpayati、limpāpeti、limpāpayati、lepeti、lepayati、lepāpeti、lepāpayati 等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4587-2-7","zh":"Vida 词根，义为获得：vindati、vindanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4588-2-5","zh":"被动：vindīyati、vindīyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4589-2-9","zh":"使役：vindeti、vindayati、vindāpeti、vindāpayahi。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4590-2-25","zh":"ī 等词尾：avindi、vindi；udaṅgaṇe tattha papaṃ avinduṃ（他们在那片空地上找到了水源）〔jā.1.1.2〕；avindiṃsu、vindiṃsu 等。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4591-2-7","zh":"Sica 词根，义为浇洒：siñcati、siñcanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4592-2-5","zh":"被动：siñcīyati、siñcīyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4593-2-20","zh":"使役：siñceti、siñcayati、siñcāpeti、siñcāpayati；siñceyya vā siñcāpeyya vā（如果自己浇洒或让人浇洒）〔pāci.140〕等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4594-2-17","zh":"Subha 词根，义为打击：yo no gāvova sumbhati（他像打牛一样打我们）〔jā.2.22.2132〕。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4594-18-47","zh":"Sumbhanti、sumbhasi、sumbhatha；bhūmiṃ sumbhāmi vegasā（我用力击打大地）〔jā.1.5.51〕；sumbhāma、sumbhiti、sumbhīti、sumbheti、sumbhoti 等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4595-2-5","zh":"Gaha 词根也收在这一类里。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4595-6-7","zh":"Gaha 词根，义为执取。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4595-8-16","zh":"依“mañca rudhādīnaṃ”这条规则，加 la 词缀，同时添加鼻化音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4596-2-20","zh":"661. 鼻化音变为 ṇ〔ka.490；rū.518；nī.982〕。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4597-2-7","zh":"在 gaha 词根中添加的鼻化音变为 ṇ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4597-8-12","zh":"依大释，la 可以选择变为长音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4598-2-16","zh":"Gaṇhāti，或 gaṇhati；gaṇhanti、gaṇhasi、gaṇhatha、gaṇhāmi、gaṇhāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4599-2-5","zh":"被动：gaṇhīyati、gaṇhīyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-4600-2-17","zh":"依“ha 换位”这条规则，ha 与 ya 互换位置：gayhati、gayhanti、gayhare。","confidence":80}
